            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f7702e07-af84-495e-9f82-83ed106ec7f4\r\n\r\nKnown gaps, all in this PR:\r\n\r\n- I don't read Arabic. With 'arabicshape' the output is byte-identical to 'rightleft' and a test checks that, but I can't say for sure that the joining forms are correct.\r\n- Inserting at the start of a right-to-left line draws the bar cursor one cell too far left. There is no cell past the right margin to put it in. 'rightleft' does the same.\r\n- Direction-marking characters (`U+202A`–`U+202E`) do nothing. Each paragraph gets one direction, from its first strong character.\r\n- Combining marks are not moved to the other side of the character they attach to.\r\n- `screenpos()` and `getmousepos()` still compute from `w_virtcol`, so they report a different column from the one the cursor is drawn in.\r\n\r\nI'll be using this branch every day for writing short stories in Hebrew, so I expect to keep finding new things!\r\n\r\n",
